# Frontend reads no secret environment variables (see
# frontend/.env.example for its one optional, non-secret
# VITE_API_BASE_URL).
#
# Backend: see backend/.env.example — VIKALP_DATABASE_PATH (optional)
# plus, since Task 35, the required authentication configuration
# (VIKALP_JWT_SECRET, VIKALP_OFFICER_USERNAME, VIKALP_OFFICER_PASSWORD)
# and optional VIKALP_JWT_EXPIRES_MINUTES.
